%% title: `unregister session`
%% summary: Remove one advisory-nudge consumer session.
%% commentary: This teardown path should remove bounded consumer state cleanly and report not-found or runtime errors explicitly.
%% sets: client
flowchart TD
    A[registered-consumer unregister request] --> B[Daemon unregister handler]
    B --> C1[Remove session from bounded daemon runtime]
    C1 -->|not found| E1[ValidationFailed or NotFound]
    C1 -->|runtime error| E2[DaemonUnavailable]
    C1 --> O1[Return unregistration accepted]
